Name: image-acquisition
Version: 0.3.1
Date: 2025-04-12
Author: Andreas Weber <andy.weber.aw@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Andreas Weber <andy.weber.aw@gmail.com>
Title: Image Acquisition
Description: The Octave-forge Image Acquisition package provides functions
 to capture images from connected devices via v4l2 on GNU/Linux or "Media Foundation"
 on MS-Windows Vista and later.
Depends: octave (>= 5.1.0)
BuildRequires: libv4l-dev (>= 0.8.8) on GNU/Linux, libfltk1.1-dev (>= 1.1.0) or libfltk1.3-dev
License: GPLv3+
